# Normalise line endings in the working tree on every platform.
#
# The CI matrix runs `cargo fmt --check` and `cargo clippy -D warnings` on
# windows-latest, where git's default `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites LF to CRLF
# on checkout. Without this file the bytes rustfmt sees on Windows are not the
# bytes it sees on Linux, so a Windows-only formatting failure is possible and
# is indistinguishable from a real diff. Pin the checkout to LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
